  "content": "\n\n<h1>Совместимость Farm 3x3 с Farmer's Delight</h1>\n<p>Этот датапак/мод обеспечивает поддержку <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a>/<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight Refabricated</a> для <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farm-3x3-mod-version\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farm 3x3</a>.</p>\n<h2>Примечания</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Требуется версия Farm 3x3 2.2.0 или новее.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Ссылки</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ffarm-3x3-farmers-delight-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"Модринт\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farm-3x3-farmers-delight-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Raixu27/Farm3x3-Farmers-Delight-Compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/available/github_64h.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f4RWVg8MgAj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>",
